logo=Modrinth&label=下載量\" /></td></tr>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/iWaY0S0z/60dc005c96d9bc5c95807c711a36e5fb2e414f24.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"蒸氣龐克紋理包圖標\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/steampunk-texture-pack\">蒸氣龐克紋理包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/steampunk-texture-pack?logo=Modrinth&label=下載量\" /></td></tr>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Ee44YG5/d511ee3a7d36c90b76a84a640bf9586995da0f44.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"埃及神話大混搭圖標\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/egyptian-mythology-mash-up\">埃及神話大混搭</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/egyptian-mythology-mash-up?logo=Modrinth&label=下載量\" /></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n![基岩版實體模型推薦](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2049db112bd3b57aea34f9ea2f04e565a87110dc.png)\n\n此資源包使用了基岩版實體模型。若無此模型，自訂實體模型將無法顯示。為獲得最佳體驗，建議使用[基岩版實體模型](https://modrinth.com/mod/bedrock-entity-models)。\n\n---\n\n此資源包是從遺留主機版移植而來的北歐神話大混搭，並採用了基岩版更新的紋理。原始紋理由4J Studios製作。\n</center>",
